---
title: Hot rooms
---
On a map of rooms, the route says which rooms a player has to pass through and which are optional [[t:267-269 s:30]].

## The rule
```text
find the route from the start to the exit
a room is on the route if any step of the route is inside it
highlight those rooms, and gray the rest
```

The talk’s uses for the gray rooms: cull them for a room-to-room game, or hide bonus things in them [[t:269-271]]. For the rooms on the route: order a story along them, since the player will probably pass through them in order [[t:274-276 s:31]].

