## Controls
This stage has no controls. It reads the rooms and the route that the stages before it made [[own]].

## What it produces, measured
@@measured

With 50 attempts the map places {{c21.rooms.median}} rooms at the median, and its route is {{c21.path.median}} steps against the caves’ {{c18.path.median}} [[run:c21.rooms.median c21.path.median c18.path.median]]. Corridors join the rooms in left-to-right order, not by the shortest way [[own]].

